begin="02:34.664" end="02:35.328" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">konagona ni</span><span begin="02:35.328" end="02:35.724" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">naru</span><span begin="02:35.724" end="02:35.985" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mae</span><span begin="02:35.985" end="02:36.318" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ni</span></text><text for="L45"><span begin="02:36.338" end="02:36.891" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">tayori</span><span begin="02:36.891" end="02:37.179" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">naku</span><span begin="02:37.179" end="02:37.476" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">temo</span><span begin="02:37.476" end="02:37.620" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ii</span><span begin="02:37.620" end="02:37.877" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">sono</span><span begin="02:37.877" end="02:38.154" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te o</span></text><text for="L46"><span begin="02:38.304" end="02:38.642" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kono</span><span begin="02:38.642" end="02:38.974" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te wa</span><span begin="02:38.974" end="02:39.305" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">jibun</span><span begin="02:39.305" end="02:39.794" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">jishin no</span><span begin="02:39.794" end="02:40.223" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mono</span><span begin="02:40.223" end="02:41.021" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">sa</span></text><text for="L47"><span begin="02:41.070" end="02:41.641" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kawara</span><span begin="02:41.641" end="02:41.962" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nai</span><span begin="02:41.962" end="02:42.304" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">hazu wa</span><span begin="02:42.304" end="02:42.507" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nai</span><span begin="02:42.507" end="02:42.772" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">yo</span><span begin="02:42.772" end="02:43.085" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te o</span><span begin="02:43.085" end="02:43.669" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nobashi</span><span begin="02:43.669" end="02:44.053" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te</span></text><text for="L48"><span begin="02:46.722" end="02:47.165" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nani mo</span><span begin="02:47.165" end="02:47.486" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kamo</span><span begin="02:47.486" end="02:47.966" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kimi shidai</span><span begin="02:47.966" end="02:48.260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">de</span><span begin="02:48.260" end="02:48.608" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">boku</span><span begin="02:48.608" end="02:49.200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">shidai</span><span begin="02:49.200" end="02:49.797" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">sa</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">未竟的心跳 笼罩这夜色</text><text for="L2">将我们包裹 赶在支离破碎之前</text><text for="L3">哪怕绵软无力 也请伸出你的手</text><text for="L4">这双手 终究属于你自己</text><text for="L5">世事绝非一成不变 伸出手吧</text><text for="L6">拥挤人潮中 无声地哽咽</text><text for="L7">匆匆步履 抹去谁人呼喊的清晨</text><text for="L8">无论岁月如何流转 都不曾干涸的</text><text for="L9">腐朽街头的 泥水冰冷刺骨</text><text for="L10">在这毫无起色的世界里</text><text for="L11">今天依然要挣扎求生</text><text for="L12">纵然荒唐可笑 却也无可奈何</text><text for="L13">我们终究 已经迈开了脚步</text><text for="L14">如同谎言 如同痴人说梦</text><text for="L15">无可救药的 我们的城市</text><text for="L16">即便如此 这双眼也真切地目睹了</text><text for="L17">这双手也真切地触碰到了 呐你看你看</text><text for="L18">你看风又吹起了 真是荒唐可笑</text><text for="L19">照亮这无可救药的黑暗</text><text for="L20">这不是梦 哪怕这座城早已走向终局</text><text for="L21">放弃也于事无补啊 啊还早还早还早</text><text for="L22">未竟的心跳 笼罩这夜色</text><text for="L23">将我们包裹 赶在支离破碎之前</text><text for="L24">哪怕绵软无力 也请伸出你的手</text><text for="L25">这双手 终究属于你自己</text><text for="L26">世事绝非一成不变 伸出手吧</text><text for="L27">漫漫永恒中 让我们不至迷失的余温</text><text for="L28">故作轻松的你 还未触及便已四散飘零</text><text for="L29">如你所愿 绝不可能</text><text for="L30">一走了之不就好了 别轻易说出口</text><text for="L31">面对这一如既往的世界</text><text for="L32">今天依然要奋力奔跑</text><text for="L33">若是不慎跌落 就死死抓住吧</text><text for="L34">灰暗苍穹中 那熠熠生辉的蔚蓝</text><text for="L35">如同谎言 如同痴人说梦</text><text for="L36">无可救药的 我们的城市</text><text for="L37">即便如此 这双眼也真切地目睹了</text><text for="L38">这双手也真切地触碰到了 呐你看你看</text><text for="L39">你看风又吹起了 真是荒唐可笑</text><text for="L40">照亮这无可救药的黑暗</text><text for="L41">这不是梦 哪怕这座城早已走向终局</text><text for="L42">放弃也于事无补啊 啊还早还早还早</text><text for="L43">未竟的心跳 笼罩这夜色</text><text for="L44">将我们包裹 赶在支离破碎之前</text><text for="L45">哪怕绵软无力 也请伸出你的手</text><text for="L46">这双手 终究属于你自己</text><text for="L47">世事绝非一成不变 伸出手吧</text><text for="L48">一切皆取决于你 也取决于我</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="02:49.797"><div begin="00:00.421" end="00:13.816" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="00:00.421" end="00:03.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.421" end="00:00.942">やり</span><span begin="00:00.942" end="00:01.577">残した</span><span begin="00:01.577" end="00:01.853">鼓動</span><span begin="00:01.853" end="00:01.978">が </span><span begin="00:01.978" end="00:02.420">この夜を</span><span begin="00:02.420" end="00:02.972">覆っ</span><span begin="00:02.972" end="00:03.337">て</span></p><p begin="00:03.337" end="00:06.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:03.337" end="00:04.099">僕らを</span><span begin="00:04.099" end="00:04.463">包んで </span><span begin="00:04.463" end="00:05.127">粉々に</span><span begin="00:05.127" end="00:05.523">なる</span><span begin="00:05.523" end="00:05.784">前</span><span begin="00:05.784" end="00:06.117">に</span></p><p begin="00:06.117" end="00:07.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:06.117" end="00:06.670">頼り</span><span begin="00:06.670" end="00:06.958">なく</span><span begin="00:06.958" end="00:07.255">ても</span><span begin="00:07.255" end="00:07.399">いい </span><span begin="00:07.399" end="00:07.656">その</span><span begin="00:07.656" end="00:07.933">手を</span></p><p begin="00:08.067" end="00:10.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:08.067" end="00:08.405">この</span><span begin="00:08.405" end="00:08.737">手は </span><span begin="00:08.737" end="00:09.068">自分</span><span begin="00:09.068" end="00:09.557">自身の</span><span begin="00:09.557" end="00:09.986">もの</span><span begin="00:09.986" end="00:10.784">さ</span></p><p begin="00:10.833" end="00:13.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:10.833" end="00:11.404">変わら</span><span begin="00:11.404" end="00:11.725">ない</span><span begin="00:11.725" end="00:12.067">はずは</span><span begin="00:12.067" end="00:12.270">ない</span><span begin="00:12.270" end="00:12.535">よ </span><span begin="00:12.535" end="00:12.848">手を</span><span begin="00:12.848" end="00:13.432">伸ばし</span><span begin="00:13.432" end="00:13.816">て</span></p></div><div begin="00:19.166" end="00:36.433" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:19.166" end="00:23.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:19.166" end="00:20.027">雑踏の</span><span begin="00:20.027" end="00:20.750">中で </span><span begin="00:21.017" end="00:21.451">声</span><span begin="00:21.451" end="00:21.749">無き</span><span begin="00:21.749" end="00:22.350">声で</span><span begin="00:22.350" end="00:22.982">泣いて</span><span begin="00:22.982" end="00:23.584">いる</span></p><p begin="00:23.584" end="00:27.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:23.584" end="00:24.450">足跡が</span><span begin="00:24.450" end="00:25.041">今 </span><span begin="00:25.301" end="00:26.199">誰かの</span><span begin="00:26.199" end="00:26.751">声を</span><span begin="00:26.751" end="00:27.245">消した</span><span begin="00:27.245" end="00:27.768">朝</span></p><p begin="00:27.817" end="00:31.482" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:27.817" end="00:28.384">いつに</span><span begin="00:28.384" end="00:28.881">なって</span><span begin="00:28.881" end="00:29.385">も </span><span begin="00:29.416" end="00:30.191">枯れる</span><span begin="00:30.191" end="00:30.972">ことの</span><span begin="00:30.972" end="00:31.482">ない</span></p><p begin="00:31.700" end="00:36.433" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:31.700" end="00:32.342">腐敗</span><span begin="00:32.342" end="00:32.723">した</span><span begin="00:32.723" end="00:33.553">街の </span><span begin="00:33.741" end="00:34.076">泥</span><span begin="00:34.076" end="00:34.866">水が</span><span begin="00:34.866" end="00:35.764">冷</span><span begin="00:35.764" end="00:36.433">たい</span></p></div><div begin="00:36.533" end="00:47.100" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="00:36.533" end="00:37.965" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:36.533" end="00:37.039">何にも</span><span begin="00:37.039" end="00:37.548">変わらない</span><span begin="00:37.548" end="00:37.831">世界</span><span begin="00:37.831" end="00:37.965">で</span></p><p begin="00:39.182" end="00:40.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:39.182" end="00:39.622">今日</span><span begin="00:39.622" end="00:39.968">だって</span><span begin="00:39.968" end="00:40.337">生きて</span><span begin="00:40.337" end="00:40.645">ゆくん</span><span begin="00:40.645" end="00:40.882">だ</span></p><p begin="00:41.682" end="00:43.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:41.682" end="00:42.316">くだら</span><span begin="00:42.316" end="00:42.576">ない</span><span begin="00:42.576" end="00:42.873">けど </span><span begin="00:42.873" end="00:43.515">仕方</span><span begin="00:43.515" end="00:43.722">ない</span><span begin="00:43.722" end="00:43.984">でしょ</span></p><p begin="00:44.017" end="00:47.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:44.017" end="00:44.504">僕ら</span><span begin="00:44.504" end="00:44.689">は</span><span begin="00:44.689" end="00:45.049">もう </span><span begin="00:45.049" end="00:45.636">歩き</span><span begin="00:45.636" end="00:46.186">始め</span><span begin="00:46.186" end="00:46.515">たん</span><span begin="00:46.515" end="00:47.100">だ</span></p></div><div begin="00:47.278" end="01:23.348" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="00:47.278" end="00:49.877" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:47.278" end="00:47.653">嘘</span><span begin="00:47.653" end="0